'''Mokomo Dukedom''' is a country located on the back of the giant elephant [[Zunisha]], in the [[New World]]. It is home to the Minks, a jungle nation of animal-people. {{Ref|1}}
== Overview ==
A jungle dukedom hidden in the Whale Forest. The arc here was long. This arc, that arc, another arc, an arc.
